  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ecbi III Europ Cap Building Inititiative 2011-2014 - ecbi  2011-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ecbi III Europ Kapacitetsbyggande Initit 2011-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The European Capacity Building Initiative (ecbi) initierades av       Oxford Climate Policy (OCP)och International Institute of Environment and Development (IIED)&#xe5;r 2005. Avsikten var att bygga kapacitet och   f&#xf6;rtroende mellan utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder och utvecklade l&#xe4;nder i FNs       klimatf&#xf6;rhandlingar. Sida finansierar bara OCPs del i denna fas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Capacity Building Initiative (ecbi) was launched by      Oxford Climate Policy (OCP)and International Institute of Environment and Development (IIED) in 2005. The objective is building and         sustaining the negotiating capacity of, and trust between, developing and and developed country climate change negotiators, in support of   the UN climate change negotiations. Sida funds OCP in this phase.</narrative>
  </description>
